5
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.300
First, you bring mindfulness to the respiration.

6
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.910
Within mindfulness, there is also an energy we call

7
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.024
concentration.

8
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:23.080
Because automatically, I must remain attentive for a

9
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:23.987
