10
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:27.710
Attempt to perceive this.

11
00:00:28.071 --> 00:00:31.501
Scientific research indicates that by working at

12
00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:32.011
this level,

13
00:00:32.271 --> 00:00:34.981
you develop empathic faculties, compassion,

14
00:00:35.021 --> 00:00:36.021
