38
00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:30.405
One speaks with their heart, in fact,

39
00:01:30.445 --> 00:01:32.765
but with the frequential, almost energetic,

40
00:01:32.805 --> 00:01:33.505
subtlety,

41
00:01:33.535 --> 00:01:35.573
one might say, of the thyroid.

42
00:01:35.603 --> 00:01:37.333
This implies that at a certain point,

43
00:01:37.373 --> 00:01:38.963
it is no longer the word itself,

44
00:01:39.003 --> 00:01:39.853
but the sound.

45
00:01:39.883 --> 00:01:41.749
It is the frequency you engage with.

46
00:01:41.779 --> 00:01:44.199
I will guide you; we will perform the first five

47
00:01:44.239 --> 00:01:45.789
steps, then we will do the Brah-mari,

48
00:01:45.819 --> 00:01:48.179
and then we will release and simply observe a kind

49
00:01:48.219 --> 00:01:49.624
