99
00:04:10.228 --> 00:04:12.148
And if you do so, you will begin

100
00:04:12.639 --> 00:04:15.109
to perceive your heart, which was there eight months

101
00:04:17.719 --> 00:04:20.849
and nine days before your thoracic respiration.

102
00:04:23.799 --> 00:04:27.619
In other words, your heart begins to beat after 21

103
00:04:27.659 --> 00:04:28.009
days.

104
00:04:28.683 --> 00:04:30.323
And so it is good to place oneself,

105
00:04:30.363 --> 00:04:32.343
from time to time, in this silence,

106
00:04:32.373 --> 00:04:34.996
because it is in silence that reorganization can

107
00:04:35.036 --> 00:04:35.386
occur.

108
00:04:35.639 --> 00:04:37.839
This embryonic force is always present,

109
00:04:37.879 --> 00:04:38.859
but to enter into

110
00:04:38.989 --> 00:04:39.499
this presence,

111
00:04:39.529 --> 00:04:42.399
this contact, you must accept to go into silence.

112
00:04:42.439 --> 00:04:43.609
You might rediscover

113
00:04:43.639 --> 00:04:44.529
a healing movement.

114
00:04:44.569 --> 00:04:46.900
Or that health can express itself, flourish more

115
00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:47.990
