118
00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.936
Thus, a need for space.

119
00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.480
If there is no space, there is no development.

120
00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.870
Therefore, both this

121
00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.420
spacious silence are required.

122
00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.890
But if you restore to the tissue this

123
00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:05.090
capacity

124
00:05:07.852 --> 00:05:09.912
to rediscover this moment of silence,

125
00:05:10.341 --> 00:05:12.831
the body knows very well how it should reorganize

126
00:05:12.871 --> 00:05:13.471
